msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"1.11.3.Final mainly fixes a regression introduced in 1.11.2.Final that makes "
"it impossible to build native executables while using both the RESTEasy and "
"OpenTracing extensions."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a safe upgrade for everyone using Quarkus 1.11."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 1.11 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-1.11[1.11 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.11.3."
"Final[the full changelog of 1.11.3.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
